Ai (Amnesiatic ESPer)
=====================

*"I have to believe that someone out there cares about me. I have to be strong for their sake!"*

*An amnesiac psychic evading the mysterious men in black who hunt her.*

**Background**

Ai awoke in an alley with no memory of who she was. As she
wandered Tokyo trying to survive, she discovered she could sense
others' thoughts and emotions, and even move objects with her
mind. Worse, she found herself doggedly pursued by strange,
unsettling men in black suits.

**Personality**

Shy and withdrawn, Ai struggles to connect with people and finds
it hard to put her feelings into words. She'd rather avoid a
problem than face it -- though her real trouble is that she has
nowhere left to run.

